sequenceDiagram
    participant Core as 运行内核
    participant Execution as 执行系统
    participant Computer as 目标工具

    Core->>Core: RunStore：状态、操作映射、工作及 Outbox
    Core->>Execution: 交付原操作请求
    Execution->>Execution: 持久保存 Inbox、去重与未处理项
    Execution-->>Core: PERSISTED：消息已持久接收
    Execution->>Execution: 接纳记录、工作与回复 Outbox 一起提交
    Execution-->>Core: ACCEPTED：业务已接纳
    Execution->>Computer: 启动准备持久化后执行并核对
    Computer-->>Execution: 原操作的效果事实
    Execution->>Execution: 效果报告与 Outbox 一起提交
    Execution-->>Core: 回交原操作效果报告
    Core->>Core: RunStore：事实、工作、Inbox 消费与回复 Outbox
    Core-->>Execution: PERSISTED：结果已持久接收
